Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The way straight to a brand new day. Into\Nanother adventure. Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's\Na fire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop\Nit We will be one, go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,year he and his crew\Nmade it to the waters of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the new world he's on\Nthe fast track to infamy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,absolutely brutal\Nabsolutely crazy he roasted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates on a skewer and\Nfilmed it for the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to see he opened fire\Non innocent civilians
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for no good reason recently\Nranked number one in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the most annoying pirates\Nwho should just go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,away competition the\Nirrepressible irredeemable
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going on a one-way trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't talk to people like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you about to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, old man! You're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies first, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you all of my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too popular with the crowd, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're jackasses anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, forget that, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Block B has just one\Nfinal competitor left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This fighter is loyal\Nto our king, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So loyal, in fact, that he brought the king\Na giant gold pillar from a distant land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's more than worthy of\Nwinning this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been ransacking\Ntowns in various countries
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,whose people slathered\Nour nation's great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stakes are already high today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but for him, they're even higher\Nas the Bullet of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And at long last, he's been granted this\Nopportunity by King Doflamingo himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The infirmaries down the hall—we're\Nlow on stretchers, so walk if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,These dudes are a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The champ really got them! Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,nice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,getter—but do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you think I'm blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how good the\Ndisguise is when it comes to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the guy who managed to swerve\Nmy career into the skids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,know his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,his face
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really messed up that\Npoor chestnut head guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm glued\Nto Chaya, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go wherever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Doe Flamingo\Nis a real hero of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a fan ever since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still have plenty to gain\Nby busting some heads out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down as\Nmany times as I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you, I'm not\Nthe same man as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, I saw the\NSky Island just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost all of my crewmates on that trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but it turned my view of the\Nwhole damn world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't hurt anyone, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm not going to hold\Na grudge against you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a big wave that's about\Nto crash through this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and I think the Doflamingo\Nship can ride it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The stakes are already high today,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but for him they're even higher\Nif he's able to achieve victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this dedicated\Ncombatant will be promoted to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,an executive position in\Nthe Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This pirate is a strong\Ncontender; he could take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a four!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, the Hyena!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Bellamy! Bellamy! Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a local, but surely\Nhe's not that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like all 138 competitors\Nhave gathered in the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're all ready
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who wants to be first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the bunch of cheaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait—that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle royale means every man\Nfor himself! You're cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:08:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,your name calling out of the way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be saying much\Nwhen we're done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,can only be one winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's sure as hell not\Ngonna be you, Bartolomeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like several of our competitors\Nhave decided to fight together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't good sportsmanship, but I suppose\Nit's not technically against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet I know who came\Nup with that plan, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the kingdom of Prodence\Nis tactician, Dogamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the flame flame fruit back\Nto Prodence with us, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ruler, Elisabello II, was always\Ndestined to be a weapon of devastation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He boasts a superhuman\Nphysique that he can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,level any opponent with\Na single deadly punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He once obliterated an entire\Nenemy fort with one blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,creating panic all over the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one drawback to his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes a full hour of\Nconcentration to build
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,up the energy for just\None of those punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it, that punch could even take\Ndown the four emperors if it hit them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but he could only use it once per fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So whether he wins or loses\Nall depends on his timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a one-of-a-kind attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They call the king punch.\NYour majesty, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to keep guarding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a chance for all\Nof you to earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect his majesty and eliminate\Nas many challenges as you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right with this, LaPont? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:11:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa's army captain helping\Na tactician from another country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Money toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the world we live in, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to make some quick cash,\Nnot chase after some pipe dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your time's up. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about that? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They fell out of the ring.\NThey're out. Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who falls into the moat\Nwon't be coming back to join us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the Coliseum's\Nmost unique attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The little fighting fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out of the frying\Npan and into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the famous Corrida Coliseum\Nfor you, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You fall, and then you say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How difficult, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Deathknotch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Abdullah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Edorstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have turned\Nyour back to me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirty cowards! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're opportunists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the water\Nwhere you belong, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, so what made you think you could\Nparticipate in a human competition anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, why don't you say something back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I pity you, huh, don't think I got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your fists do the talking—oh,\Nthat sounds like a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,idea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,4,000 wrist fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As Jinbe once told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,my friend and hope of our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we must find a way to create\Ngood relations with fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I shall continue\Nfighting to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears Blue Gilly has decided to\Nstart attacking Elisabello II's entourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that blue-haired bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you lose to some\Nspindly unarmed nobody? It...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't really matter how\Nspindly this unarmed freak is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not come closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no fun when you're so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not shy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's from the Long Leg tribe,\Nso attack his legs, numbskulls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His movements are unpredictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't read them at all! Hew! Hew! Hew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's three more down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Bluegilly has done it again by\Nquite literally kicking some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's that gladiator\Nin the Skull Cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a real powerhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In all the years I've been fighting\Nhere, I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Every gladiator from the Coliseum is\Ntrained to fight, both a sword and a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But he uses just a blade, like\Na samurai from the Wano Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,him let's test his
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,skill i'm game too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,slow you see that gladiator the one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in the cape with the blue skull yeah\Nquite the experienced fighter rather
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,odd that he's new here i thought the\Nsame at first but i've got this feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,like i've seen him somewhere a man\Nlike that who fought without a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, move it, you'll get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't anybody attacking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all a joke to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently he's one of those\Ninsufferable newcomers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the same as that Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to teach\Nhim a lesson as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those things, Cabbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Posters to locate members\Nof the worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need some fresh copies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The knife marks make it hard to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is dumb, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not till I kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the prize for this competition\Nis so desirable, I was hoping Apu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or Kid, or at least one\Nof them would enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not even sure\NI'd know if I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:16:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Any of them could have concealed\Ntheir faces the way Burgess did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if I do see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I wait for them to\Nmove on to the next round?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I watch\Nthe fight with you gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, we have a good view\Nof the fight from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How's old Garp doing these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you mean you know my grandpa? You!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Know him? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Years ago, he nearly killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I carry that grudge against him,\Nhis children, and his grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You
